@startuml
title 现状业务序列图 — 每周人工统计
!include course-notation.iuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #8B96A5
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
autonumber
participant "<$worker>\n办公部部长" as O

O -> O: 收集、核对本周工作量材料
O -> O: 汇总成员工时并整理津贴统计依据
note right of O
  办公部承担统计，部长负责中心周报。
  现状每周人工整理约 1 小时。
  本图仅表达已确认的责任片段，
  不增设未确认的逐级报送岗位。
end note
@enduml
